# Route: guide 41 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to 58, 43
# quests, 3.3 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Swamp of Sorrows, Blasted Lands, Feralas, Darnassus, Wetlands,
# Moonglade): Splinterspear Junction -> Itharius's Cave -> Splinterspear
# Junction -> Misty Reed Strand -> Dreadmaul Hold -> Rise of the Defiler ->
# Serpent's Coil -> Nethergarde Keep -> The Dark Portal -> Rise of the Defiler
# -> Altar of Storms -> Sardor Isle -> The Twin Colossals -> ….
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Nekrum's Medallion (2991), The Crone of the Kraul (1101),
# Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin (7441), Elven Legends (7482),
# Lethtendris's Web (7488), In Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls
# (1199), The Fury Runs Deep (378), The Fury Runs Deep (378), Lost in the
# Thicket Things (95647), Fallen in the Fen (95795), Heartwoven (95809),
# Highland Hides (98815), Highland Hides (98815), Prehistoric Prism (98824),
# Prehistoric Prism (98824).

